        "textualBasisJa": "For Moses writes about the righteousness of the law, “The one who does them will live by them.”"
      },
      {
        "ref": "ROM 10:19 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "But I ask, didn’t Israel know? First Moses says, “I will provoke you to jealousy with that which is no nation. I will make you angry with a nation void of understanding.”"
      }
